{"t":"Piece of Marble Rock","s":"piece-of-marble-rock-0f3cc","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Piece_of_Marble_Rock_988077.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Piece of Marble Rock</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Piece of Marble Rock\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Piece_of_Marble_Rock_988077.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Household Items<br/>Decorations</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"weight\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Weight</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">10.00 oz</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1,000 - 2,500 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not bought by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.54<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 9, 2009<br/>Christmas Update 2009</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20100205203230&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Piece_of_Marble_Rock_988077.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a piece of marble rock.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 10.00 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">It seems just perfect to try and create something out of it with a sharp obsidian knife.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>If you use an <a href=\"#/wiki/Obsidian%20Knife\">Obsidian Knife</a> on it, you will either break it or carve one of the following:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Rough Marble Statue\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Rough_Marble_Statue_da0394.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span> Rough Marble Statue</li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Marble Statue\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Marble_Statue_54e1e4.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span> Marble Statue</li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Beautiful Marble Statue\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Beautiful_Marble_Statue_1b53d1.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Beautiful%20Marble%20Statue\">Beautiful Marble Statue</a></li></ul>\n<p>See a research article by Tibia-Stats here to discover what the chances for getting each form of the marble statues are.<br/><span style=\"line-height: 20px; margin-top: 13px;\"><i> <b>See also:</b> Piece of Marble Rock/Sculpting Statistics </i> </span>\nOne can be obtained through the <a href=\"#/quest/jack-to-the-future-quest\">Jack to the Future Quest</a>.<br/>You can earn the achievement Marblelous by sculpting a <a href=\"#/wiki/Beautiful%20Marble%20Statue\">Beautiful Marble Statue</a> and the achievement Marble Madness by sculpting five <a href=\"#/wiki/Beautiful%20Marble%20Statue\">Beautiful Marble Statues</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>Before Update 8.60, this item could only be looted rarely from <a href=\"#/wiki/Eternal%20Guardian\">Eternal Guardians</a>. With this update, however, <a href=\"#/wiki/Achievements\">achievements</a> got introduced. Two of these were for sculpting <a href=\"#/wiki/Beautiful%20Marble%20Statue\">Beautiful Marble Statues</a>, which only happens one in a hundred tries. As Eternal Guardians only spawned in the area that can only be accessed once a week for the Zze Art of War task of the <a href=\"#/quest/children-of-the-revolution-quest\">Children of the Revolution Quest</a>, these achievements would be nearly impossible to get if it stayed this way. That is why Chayenne, after being made aware of this issue, added spawns of Eternal Guardians to <a href=\"#/wiki/Deeper%20Banuta\">Deeper Banuta</a> and also added this item to the loot of <a href=\"#/wiki/Gargoyle\">Gargoyles</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Golem\">Stone Golems</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Eternal%20Guardian\">Eternal Guardian</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gargoyle\">Gargoyle</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Golem\">Stone Golem</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Twisted%20Shaper\">Twisted Shaper</a></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Astral%20Shapers\">Astral Shapers</a></li><li>Attack Effects</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Beautiful%20Marble%20Statue\">Beautiful Marble Statue</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/beggar-outfits-quest\">Beggar Outfits Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Beregar\">Beregar</a></li><li>Decorations</li><li>Earth</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Eternal%20Guardian\">Eternal Guardian</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gargoyle\">Gargoyle</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Geo-Elementals\">Geo-Elementals</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Hall%20of%20the%20Colossi\">Hall of the Colossi</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Invisibility\">Invisibility</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Isle%20of%20Evil\">Isle of Evil</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/jack-to-the-future-quest\">Jack to the Future Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kazordoon</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lizards\">Lizards</a></li><li>Marble Madness</li><li>Marble Statue</li><li>Marblelous</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Obsidian%20Knife\">Obsidian Knife</a></li><li>Quests</li><li>Rough Marble Statue</li><li>Status Effects</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Golem\">Stone Golem</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Tibia%20Tales\">Tibia Tales</a></li><li>Trembling Effect</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Twisted%20Shaper\">Twisted Shaper</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["jack-to-the-future-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"jack-to-the-future-quest","quest":"Jack to the Future Quest","kind":"reward"}],"drops":[{"creature":"Eternal Guardian","pct":0.492,"qty":"1","rarity":"raro","hp":"2,500","exp":"1,800","loc":"North-east Muggy Plains , Deeper Banuta .","places":[{"name":"Muggy Plains","x":33270,"y":31165,"z":7,"